## Input

```css
.missing-interpolation-end {
  --image: url(/icons/#{$asset);
  color: red;
}
.after-interpolation { color: blue; }

.missing-url-end {
  --image: url(/icons/mark.svg;
}
.after-url { color: green; }

.mismatched-block {
  --image: url(var(--image]);
  color: red;
}
.after-block { color: blue; }

